---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
metaTitle: "Projects: Handmade Kitchens, Furniture & Joinery | Joel Dyter, Hebden Bridge"
description: "Kitchens, staircases, furniture and joinery handmade by Joel Dyter. Follow projects from the workshop to the finished room."
permalink: /projects/
---
<header class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Projects</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Projects from the workshop</h1>
    <p class="lede">Kitchens, staircases, furniture and joinery, each made by hand in Joel's Hebden Bridge workshop. Some projects follow the work from the first drawing to the finished room, so you can see how yours would take shape.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    {%- set cats = collections.projects | categories -%}
    <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects" data-filters hidden>
      <button type="button" class="filter is-active" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All</button>
      {%- for c in cats %}<button type="button" class="filter" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="{{ c }}">{{ c }}</button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="cards cards--list" data-filter-list>
      {%- asyncEach p in collections.projects %}<li data-category="{{ p.data.category }}">{% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}</li>{% endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
